Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:25.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我擔心你 我想幫助你 我們心意相通
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:29.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這還不足以作為一起戰鬥的理由嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.37,0:00:33.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我交到朋友了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:44.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,追趕被綁架的小空 我從自己的世界 掉落到了天窗市...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:45.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,錯了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:50.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我威風凌凌亮相定場 遇見了一位姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.07,0:00:53.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,她叫虹丘真白
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:01.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學使用天空幻鏡 變身為了Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.90,0:01:06.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 現在是我們兩個人來保護小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:15.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我這個只顧著英雄鍛鍊的人 交到的第一位朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:18.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友... 朋友...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.97,0:01:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\c&H535354&\frz285.2\pos(1304,533)}{\3c&H000000&\3a&HFF&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&\c&H3D3C3F&\fn@Droid Sans Fallback}兩個人是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:22.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 不知道為什麼 一說這個詞就讓人心跳加速！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:38.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 差點忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.73,0:01:41.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.21,0:01:46.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,早安！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.89,0:01:48.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,早 小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:53.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 你怎麼了？打扮成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.71,0:01:56.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這是學校的制服！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:02:00.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,非常漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.09,0:02:02.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就開學了...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:05.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,話說小晴 你知道學校嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.35,0:02:08.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,知道 當然知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.26,0:02:12.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地也有學校 我也有上學的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.26,0:02:12.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(635,960)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.26,0:02:17.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 在這方面 那邊跟這邊世界是相同的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:18.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（開關門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:24.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我出門了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.91,0:02:28.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天的電視節目很有趣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:31.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚會播什麼節目呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:33.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:39.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,前幾天 我嘗試了一下 倒立著能夠走多少步...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:41.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}咦？（心聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.73,0:02:47.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對對 小空在睡覺的時候  偶爾是會說夢話的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:50.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,很可愛吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.47,0:02:51.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}欸欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:58.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那什麼... 小晴 送我到這裡就可以了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:02:59.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 這裡無關者禁止入內
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:09.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 學校是誰都可以自由出入的場所 這是藍天大地的常識...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:10.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:13.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不能說藍天大地的事情！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:15.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.88,0:03:19.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}吐露心聲！小晴真情流露
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:01.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道不能進入的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:03.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次要多注意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.55,0:05:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\3a&HFF&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&\fn@Droid Sans Fallback\frx16\fry352\frz273.9\pos(938.4,485.8)}{\fs50}私立天窗學院
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:07.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:11.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼小晴 放學見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:14.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 上學要用功啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:15.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.18,0:05:23.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,既然如此！我就做好我分內的事情！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:25.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,讓整間房子！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:28.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,都閃閃發光！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:31.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對這家人收留了我們 略表恩義！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:34.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:35.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,抽空學習！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:37.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,照料小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:39.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,鍛鍊也不能忘！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:41.09,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有好多能夠做的事情！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.57,0:05:51.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有能夠做的事情了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:57.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,才11點半...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:01.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:10.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 現在在做什麼呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請進
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:22.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,請問... 還有我能夠幫上忙的事情嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊 你來得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.19,0:06:32.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,弄這個 還挺費力氣的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:34.10,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1155,25.4)}{\fs50}棉花糖 2kg 砂鐵 100g 小麥粉 1kg\N章魚足尖 200g 草莓 300g 貓頭鷹的羽毛\N黏土 600g 奶糖 2箱 鈕扣電池 CR2032\N貝殼 1kg 櫻花花瓣 5枚 筆記本 2冊 葡萄汁\N柊樹葉 1枚 琉璃瓶 2個 鬱金香的花 雨滴\N生薑 2個 漂亮的珊瑚 2個 大蒜 3個\N鐵質澆水壺 魚的鱗片 5枚 樹根 250g\N南瓜 1kg 芥菜的種子 1kg 毛茛 50g
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.55,0:06:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距離完成通道 還有很多的步驟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:42.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,能幫上忙就好！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:46.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 一直都在做這麼麻煩的事情嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:49.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.18,0:06:51.67,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,膩害！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.07,0:06:59.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:05.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,上次真的很抱歉！我只顧自己的事情...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:11.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對著由由阿姨發脾氣...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都過去了 別在意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在感覺怎麼樣？習慣這邊世界的生活了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:22.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,習慣了 可是我處處都受到你們的照顧...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:26.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都在給大家添麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.58,0:07:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有的事 小晴妹妹做任何事情都竭盡全力的態度
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:33.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是非常難能可貴的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:40.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然會遇到很多困難 這邊的世界有很多吸引人的事物 沒錯吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.03,0:07:45.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 今天見到的真白同學的學校 也很有趣的樣子！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也想上學嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:49.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...不
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:52.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我在這個家裡還有要做的事情...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.63,0:08:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:02.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能再麻煩你去買點東西嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:09.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.75,0:08:11.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:14.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:16.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:18.67,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 有點小事想要勞煩...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.35,0:08:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白跟我們一起去吃飯吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:33.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:35.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴你也...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:37.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\c&HA358FF&\3c&H000000&\3a&HFF&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&\pos(808.8,603.4)}唯美著迷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}棉花糖 2kg\N章魚足尖 200g\N貓頭鷹的羽毛\N鈕扣電池 CR2032\N筆記本 2冊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.70,0:08:43.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這也是打開通道需要用到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後還是買了香粉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Powder Fragrance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈 弄個香噴噴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.93,0:08:54.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇... 好可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:58.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學應該很喜歡吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:02.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:08.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.31,0:09:12.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:15.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼在這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？剛放學哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你倒是怎麼了？愁眉苦臉的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:24.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先把心情嗨起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.63,0:09:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有精神了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:44.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:48.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你的表情 煩惱還沒有解決呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天怎麼一個人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:58.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是這樣的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.77,0:10:00.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學今天開始去上學了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.15,0:10:04.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我是按照由由阿姨的囑託 來幫忙跑腿的...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:10.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,然後...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴是跟小白分開了 寂寞了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:20.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？是... 是這樣的嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.43,0:10:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂的哦 小白的溫柔 就像是太陽公公暖洋洋的光芒一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白不在身邊 一下子就會覺得好寂寞...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:30.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:35.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我就納悶今天怎麼跟平時不一樣了 原因就在於！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.79,0:10:39.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天沒跟真白同學在一起！就是這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈！氣勢沖天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.98,0:10:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 你是不是搞錯了對象啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去跟小白本人說吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:53.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,說不出口...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:57.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要跟真白同學說 好難為情的...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 再陪我一會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:08.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 能夠試用一下商品嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.34,0:11:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以 請用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝 你坐這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:13.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用這個 還有這個！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.33,0:11:19.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶姐 我不怎麼化妝...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,化妝不僅僅是讓人打扮得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在缺乏勇氣的時候 會給予你力量的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,個人理解 啊哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.67,0:11:51.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.97,0:11:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後再來一點亮亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:02.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害... 一閃一閃的 而且...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:06.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好香啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情也閃亮了起來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:10.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.78,0:12:13.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有種無所不能的感覺！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:16.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 小晴要把剛才的感情 好好地傳達給小白哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:25.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一路順風
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:34.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶姐 謝謝你了！我走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（開關門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 青春啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:46.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要告訴她！我的感情...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.75,0:13:01.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.14,0:13:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.55,0:13:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（鈴聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:23.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我來幫你！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.27,0:13:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小事一樁！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.87,0:13:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:50.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不能打架！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:51.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,再見！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:56.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要趕快了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\c&H211C16&\3c&HF5F5F5&\4c&HF5F5F5&\frz4.762\pos(628.8,365.8)}禁止通行 不能進入哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:03.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:04.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這次是道路封閉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.79,0:14:10.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 道路封閉算得了什麼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:14.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:26.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！小晴？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:29.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:32.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？你跑到這裡來...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.09,0:14:43.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有... 有件事一定要跟真白同學說...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:49.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天心裡一直都很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:53.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,終於明白是什麼原因了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.03,0:14:56.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.65,0:15:01.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和真白同學一起...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:05.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,停！停下 停下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.37,0:15:11.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你又出現了呢 卡疤痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:13.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:18.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我上次啊 因為關東煮是低卡路里 所以能量不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:20.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,才會以失敗而告終...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:26.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天點了超高卡路裡的外賣...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.65,0:15:27.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,再高也是浪費！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:31.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,應該說 你連1秒的戲份都沒有！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:33.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,別來礙事！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.87,0:15:39.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不爽啊！那就滿足你們 這就開干！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:46.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:49.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.67,0:16:00.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:04.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要變身了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.13,0:16:06.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
