Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:50.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,一上來就是兩個Precure...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:53.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,給我把她們一網打盡 亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:55.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:07.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:13.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:17.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:22.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,被防住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,招數不起效果嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:32.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咳咳咳...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:33.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,它在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:41.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈！這下你們玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:43.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我啊 強啊... 欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:47.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.34,0:18:50.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就算被迷霧阻礙了...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:53.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,只要跨越過去 就能夠解決麻煩！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.55,0:19:05.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空藍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.55,0:19:05.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:10.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,稜鏡白！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:10.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism White！
